{
  "title": "Well-Architected · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "설계 선택을 평가하는 AWS의 여섯 기둥이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Well-Architected</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#operational-excellence\">Operational Excellence</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#security\">Security</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#reliability\">Reliability</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#performance-efficiency\">Performance Efficiency</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#cost-optimization\">Cost Optimization</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#sustainability\">Sustainability</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>기초</span><span>62 / 62</span></div><h1>Well-Architected</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 6 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Well-Architected Framework는 운영 중인 워크로드의 설계 선택을 여섯 Pillar로 점검하는 체계다. 서비스 이름을 외우는 것보다 어떤 요구사항을 충족하고 어떤 비용·위험을 만드는지 판단하는 데 쓰인다.</p><p>SAA-C03 문제에서는 보안, 복원력, 성능, 비용 요구가 동시에 주어지는 경우가 많다. 문제의 필수 조건을 먼저 확인한 뒤 운영 부담까지 포함해 가장 적절한 구성을 고른다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"요구사항에서 설계 검토까지\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>요구사항에서 설계 검토까지</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Business requirements</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Security + Reliability</strong><small>권한·장애·복구 목표</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Architecture choices</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a>·Backup</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Review</strong><small>실제 복구·접근 검증</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Resource efficiency</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Performance + Cost</strong><small>지연·처리량·예산</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#operational-excellence\">Operational Excellence</a></strong><small>배포·관측·운영 자동화</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Sustainability</strong><small>활용률·불필요한 자원 개선</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">여섯 Pillar를 함께 검토하며 요구사항별 Trade-off를 기록한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"operational-excellence\"><h2>Operational Excellence<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#operational-excellence\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>운영 절차를 코드화하고 Observability로 상태를 확인하며 작은 변경을 반복한다. 장애 대응 Runbook과 변경 후 검증이 포함된다. 시스템을 배포하는 것뿐 아니라 지속적으로 운영 가능한지를 평가한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"security\"><h2>Security<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#security\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Identity, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#mfa-access-analyzer-and-least-privilege\">Least Privilege</a>, 데이터 보호, 탐지와 Incident Response를 다룬다. 네트워크를 Private으로 만들었다고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>이나 Encryption 요구가 충족되는 것은 아니다. 계층별로 권한과 방어 수단을 구성한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"reliability\"><h2>Reliability<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#reliability\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>장애를 견디고 요구한 시간 내 복구할 수 있도록 설계한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a>, 용량 관리, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a>, Failover와 DR 테스트가 함께 필요하다. 복구 계획은 실제 복원·전환을 시험해야 의미가 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"performance-efficiency\"><h2>Performance Efficiency<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#performance-efficiency\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>워크로드에 맞는 Compute, Storage, Database, Network를 선택하고 변화를 측정한다. CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> 부족과 I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span> 부족을 구분해야 올바른 확장 수단을 선택할 수 있다. 무조건 큰 Instance가 최선이라는 의미는 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cost-optimization\"><h2>Cost Optimization<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#cost-optimization\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>필요한 성능과 신뢰성을 유지하면서 불필요한 자원·전송·요청 비용을 줄인다. Right Sizing, 구매 약정, Storage Lifecycle과 관리형 서비스를 비교한다. 직접 운영하는 인건비와 장애 비용도 함께 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"sustainability\"><h2>Sustainability<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#sustainability\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>수요에 맞춰 자원을 줄이고 활용률을 높이며 불필요한 처리·저장을 피한다. 효율적인 코드와 데이터 보존 정책도 영향을 준다. 같은 기능을 더 적은 자원으로 제공하는 선택을 검토한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>항상 켜 둔 최대 크기의 개발 서버를 요구 성능에 맞게 줄이고, 사용하지 않는 시간에 중지하는 선택은 비용과 자원 효율을 함께 개선한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>무조건 가장 비싼 고가용성 구성이 정답인 것은 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/framework/the-pillars-of-the-framework.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">wellarchitected/latest/framework/the-pillars-of-the-framework.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q004/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q004\" data-question=\"Q004\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q004</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q004/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Cost optimization and reliability requirements appear to conflict. What is the best architectural decision?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Increase only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Evaluate business RPO and RTO requirements alongside cost</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Replicate every system across multiple Regions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Always choose the least expensive single-AZ deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a>는 여러 기둥의 요구와 균형을 함께 평가한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q001\" data-question=\"Q001\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q001</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application must remain available during a prolonged outage of the entire Seoul Region. What is the minimum scope for replication?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A different AWS Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A different subnet in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A different Availability Zone in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A different ENI in the same Availability Zone</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 분리는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 안의 장애를 다룬다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 수준 장애는 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 복제와 전환이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q099\" data-question=\"Q099\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q099</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q099/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A service runs in two AZs, but recovery from a Region outage takes a week. What improvement addresses an RTO requirement of one hour?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q099\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add another EC2 instance in the same AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q099\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Change only the network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q099\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign a fixed Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q099\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Prepare a recovery environment and failover procedure in another Region</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 장애 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>를 줄이려면 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>에서 정해진 시간 내 서비스를 켤 수 있는 DR 환경과 검증이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q098\" data-question=\"Q098\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q098</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q098/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a Compute Savings Plan but must also ensure that matching EC2 capacity is available in one specific Availability Zone for a launch. Which additional option should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A regional Reserved Instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q098\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Spot Fleet with no On-Demand capacity</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 사용 비용 할인이며 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">On-Demand Capacity Reservation</a>은 지정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·구성의 실행 용량을 확보한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>도 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q002\" data-question=\"Q002\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q002</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web tier must withstand a data center failure within one Region. Which deployment is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Two ENIs on the same EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances using one EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances in a single Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances deployed across different Availability Zones</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>는 독립적인 장애 영역이다. 서로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 웹 인스턴스를 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">이전 용어 <b>WAF / Shield</b></a></span><span></span></nav></div></div>"
}
